  "title": "ZK International Group Co., Ltd. Celebrates Prestigious Recognition as a National “Little Giant Enterprise”",
  "summary": "Company Chairman Emphasizes Commitment to Technological Innovation and Global Expansion WENZHOU, China, Dec. 14, 2023 /PRNewswire/ — ZK International Group Co., Ltd. (Nasdaq: ZKIN) (“ZKIN”, “ZK International” or the “Company”), a pioneer in innovation and technology, proudly announces its selection as one of the distinguished “Specialized, Elaborative, Characteristic, and Innovative Little Giant Enterprises” by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology. This prestigious […]",
